        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the past, I was not even protected by my homeroom teacher.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And now that I am a homeroom teacher, I am also not protected by anyone.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993640/extras/b882b4e7bf50aba4be3d61c018cd01bd.avif?t=1780975342\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Present (202X)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z High School teacher Ko Hae-won's past traumas resurface when he sees Woo Jin-woo, a student in his class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993640/extras/6dcc814a64505b8fbc764a3b276ca991.avif?t=1780975342\" width=1560 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long ago (200X)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Middle School in the era before the Students’ Human Rights Ordinance, when corporal punishment was widespread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I&quot; was writing a novel as a hobby, but my homeroom teacher caught me...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature Introduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Chapters in total, no choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 1.5~2 Hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a depiction of violence and suicide. Please be aware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo development by Ren'Py.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo retouching BG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silhouette characters and no voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Korean and Japanese are supported.</p></li></ul>",
